{
  "about": "Test tiers for ZBTerm. docs/acceptance/run.sh reads this file; docs/acceptance/README.md explains it. Script ids are <kit>/<script name without .sh>; test ids are paths from the repo root. Patterns are bash [[ == ]] patterns, where * also matches '/'.",
